{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act41side_level_act41side_07_end",
  "groupId": "act41side",
  "stageId": "act41side_07",
  "title": "烧灯者",
  "storyCode": "EA-7",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act41side/level_act41side_07_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "4bd76085a2605958369cd6e9c50d4212ba617fd4e4711770edc6252275c670a0",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "涅梅丝、苇草......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "在城门口，游牧民最后一次望向远方的堡垒。\n突然浓烈起来的焦煳味让她想拔腿就跑。她明白这意味着什么。\n可无论拉芙希妮是否成功，自己都应当像涅梅丝说的，立刻离开城市，去找守灵人，去请他们过来，越快越好。\n但涅梅丝说话时尽管强硬，却怎么都不像是相信事情有转机，也不像相信自己能请来守灵人。\n刺鼻的焦煳味同样从涅梅丝身上散发出来，让布莉吉想起只有死者才会有的偏执。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“放逐王”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "还在等谁呢？等死亡摸到你的后脑勺，再和它比比谁跑得快吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......谁？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“放逐王”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哦，我都忘了，你能听见我说话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我能听见。我甚至能感受到你就在那里......但我看不见你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“放逐王”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "赶快离开这座城市吧，局外人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "听你说话，你好像也是局外人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“放逐王”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "当然。局外人好心提醒另一个局外人，这不是天经地义的事吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“放逐王”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "布莉吉，活着。活着比什么都重要。最迟到明天的太阳升起之前，这座城市一定会死去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“放逐王”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "听涅梅丝的话，去找她的同族，然后跑得远远的，再也不要回来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......你说得对，我该走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但我会回来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“放逐王”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "回来？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“放逐王”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈，愚蠢和倔强还真是代代相传！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“放逐王”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "她拼了命把你往城外赶，你却要傻乎乎地自己跑回来？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "果然，你也觉得涅梅丝只是在找个借口让我活下来，是吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“放逐王”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不然呢？你以为自己能说动那些木头脑袋？你就用手拽吧，看看明年春天会不会有一个木头脑袋发了芽，愿意跟你进黑林！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我讨厌你现在说话的腔调，看不见的弟兄。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“放逐王”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你管我叫什么？弟兄？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你身上的煳味难闻得要命，煳味之外的部分却又和游牧人有点像，我不知道你到底和我们有没有关系，干脆就这么叫你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“放逐王”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈哈......哈哈哈哈哈哈！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“放逐王”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "来打个赌吧，布莉吉！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "打赌？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“放逐王”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "赌你离开之后，不可能在今夜，在纳斯尔纱焚尽之前回来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你要赌的明明就不是这个。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“放逐王”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哦？那你说我赌的是什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你只想证明自己是对的，活下去比什么都重要。你觉得我最终也会这么做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但是，我跟你赌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“放逐王”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那你还等什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "只是觉得不太公平。如果你赢了，我会后悔一辈子。可要是我赢了，你也不过是看戏而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "要是我赢了，就回你该回的地方吧，好吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“放逐王”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“放逐王”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你觉得我该回哪里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我不知道，可你的家肯定不在这里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你好像被这座城市里的人狠狠地背叛过，可你又狠不下心去伤害他们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你装作乐意看人自食其果的样子，可你刚刚说城市就要烧毁的时候......其实一点都不开心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你是我见过最别扭的家伙——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“放逐王”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "够了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“放逐王”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我答应你。要是你赢了，我就该回哪去回哪去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“放逐王”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但这可是件大事，不是你傻乎乎地跑回来送死就能办成的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那你还需要我做什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“放逐王”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "帮我向城外那帮木头脑袋们传个话，你就说......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“放逐王”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（古老的廷盖语）“已经六百多年，早就没人怨你们了，赶紧去做你们应该做的。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“放逐王”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哦，再加一句，（古老的廷盖语）“我真是*粗口*了，一帮永远不开窍的木头脑袋！”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊......啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“放逐王”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "连同那句粗口，给我向那群蠢货一字一句地复述下来，听见了吗？用不用我再骂一次？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不、不用，族中的长老偶尔会用这种语言交谈，我多少听得懂......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“放逐王”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那就去吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“放逐王”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "还等什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你跟我绕了这么大弯子，就只是在犹豫要不要把这句话告诉我，是吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“放逐王”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......现在，立刻，给我跑起来！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "金发的游牧人深吸了一口气，奔向城外。\n而她终究没能看见的先祖一个人伫立在原地，久久没有挪动一步。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“放逐王”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "愚蠢和倔强......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“放逐王”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......还真是代代相传啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "涅梅丝转身离开，拉芙希妮则望向黑林。\n太阳已经落到地平线下，宵禁即将生效。\n而她远远望见，比任何时候都要浓烈的黑雾，正从林中向纳斯尔纱蔓延。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呼、呼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "赶上了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她对着城外的黑雾举起手中的枪，在满城的紫色中点亮一盏明黄色的火焰。\n就好像接收到什么信号一样，雾气缓缓爬升，直至与拉芙希妮枪尖的火齐平。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "来这里，来温暖的、光亮的、还有生命留存的地方......对，来这里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怎么，这次又要假装我不存在吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我不会让你们如愿的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在真正的黑暗到来之前，我决不会熄灭这盏灯火。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "雾气被她手中的火吸引，却又无法靠近，于是顺着街道流淌开去。\n过不多久，雾气再回来时，却已经不再是她的火焰能吸引、能驱散得了的了。\n雾中有如金铁交鸣，她突然觉得眼前的一切都一下子变暗——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "黑雾降临了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "对，这就是我的答案......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "它还没有完成，它还需要时间。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那可说不准。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "人们还没有在死火中彻底沦为僵死或狂暴的行尸，他们还活着，他们还来得及把火还回去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在涅梅丝将人们唤醒之前，你哪里都别想去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可笑？也许吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "和你相比，也许我的力量、我的智慧、我的法术的确都微不足道到可笑的地步。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但我所拥有的，唯有决心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "涅梅丝一路将棺椁拖上长廊。\n红龙的遗骸没有燃烧，只是静静躺在那里。\n对普通人来说，死亡就该是这副样子，可对涅梅丝而言，她甚至能听见有缥缈的声音正在耳边嘲笑自己。\n离群的守灵人没有任何踌躇，就将那瘫软的身体拉了起来，扔进棺椁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "涅梅丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "棺椁，红龙，你最后的归宿......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "涅梅丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你们这样的人都该早早回到这样的归宿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "涅梅丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你现在还在什么地方，还带着你那扭曲的笑容看着我们吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "涅梅丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但至少这具躯壳你已经再也无法掌控了，否则你现在就该把我烧成灰烬，是不是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "涅梅丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哦，还有你从不离身的这杆长枪......你曾从中喷出多少火焰，又害了多少个像库林那样的人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "涅梅丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "看，你自己都不知道了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "涅梅丝费力地举起那杆长枪，把枪尖狠狠扎进棺椁之中。\n仅仅一瞬，火焰就从枪尖蔓延到整个棺椁，然后顺着用来把棺椁和涅梅丝连在一起的绳子一路烧过，和涅梅丝自己身上的紫火融为一体。\n几乎致命的寒冷瞬间爬过涅梅丝全身，但她已经很难感觉到什么温度了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "涅梅丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "认命吧，你现在由我摆布了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "涅梅丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "库林下定的决心，没有做完的事情，我会替他完成。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "涅梅丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们走吧，去那些低贱的、受蔑视的，却在你窃取了胜利的这场战争中受苦的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "涅梅丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你会被所有人看见，你的死亡会印在所有人眼中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "涅梅丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他们会意识到，你死了。那高傲的、不可一世的红龙死了。爱布拉娜·都柏林就躺在这冰冷地燃烧着的棺椁之中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "涅梅丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "然后......他们会怎么做呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "涅梅丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我当然希望他们能和拉芙希妮预想的一样，在得知你的死讯之后清醒过来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "涅梅丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他们会知道你所代表的时日已经结束，纳斯尔纱会从这场灾难中死里逃生，塔拉不必用一座城市的毁灭来庆祝自己的新生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "涅梅丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但是，哈哈......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "涅梅丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我一定是被你的火也搞得晕头转向了，红龙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "涅梅丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "为什么我突然觉得另一个结局......毁灭的结局......也不坏呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "涅梅丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "毕竟杀了你的另有其人，而现在......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "涅梅丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "现在才是我对你的复仇啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "棺椁仍然默然无语，涅梅丝也不再说话。\n她沉默、癫狂而坚定地把那具燃烧的棺椁拖下楼梯，刻意让它和每一级台阶磕碰，发出不知是碰撞还是摩擦的怪声......\n宛如死者干枯的嘲弄。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
